ISO-10303-21;
/* Tb009: two EDGE_CURVEs crossing at 3.0E-7 mm separation below declared 1.0E-6 tolerance; receiver rounding to 1e-6 sees edges touching (no self-intersection); exact receiver sees self-intersection; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET — OCC yields empty */
